	(text "IMU - TDK InvenSense ICM-42688-P (LCSC C1850418, JLCPCB extended part)\nI2C mode: AP_CS = VDDIO, address 0x68 (AP_AD0 = GND). Bus to FPGA: IMU_SCL E7, IMU_SDA D7,\nIMU_INT1 C1, IMU_INT2 D1 (pin 9 can be INT2 or FSYNC input, e.g. camera frame sync from FPGA).\nDecoupling per DS-000347 Table 10: VDD 0.1 uF + 2.2 uF, VDDIO 10 nF. Pull-ups 4.7k to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
